        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 734,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 379,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "Because of the low resolution in the vertical, the dispersion relation for the one layer system only approximates the linear dispersion well in a certain range. In order to control this range it is possible to introduce a tuning coefficient  into the vertical momentum equation:"
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
